<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of May 30, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						May 30   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,786  2,287   3,101</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 57     75	62</p>
<p>CCC					    1,277  1,277   1,307</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,120  3,639   4,470</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				    438    566   1,240</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				181    180     409</p>
<p>CCC					    3,108  3,108   1,958</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,727  3,854   3,607</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
